THE MACHINE CAN FALL ON WHAT IS AROUND IT. It weighs 1.5 kg, it carries a
phone, and its brake is a spring: read docs/ASSEMBLY.md, check the four brake
switches, and keep your fingers out of the wheels while it is powered.
